  358: - [AC-S-002-US1-5] Given a patient has entered 5 wrong codes for a phone number, When they try again within 15 minutes (with the old or a new code), Then the system refuses and says to wait, and after 15 minutes a new code can be requested. (source: FR-002, NFR-006)
  360: - [AC-S-002-US1-7] Given a single network address or a single day has produced too many code requests, When another code is requested, Then the request is refused without sending an SMS. (source: NFR-006)
