  397: - [AC-S-002-US3-2] Given an active staff account, When a wrong password is entered, Then the screen says the username or password is wrong without saying which one. (source: FR-003, NFR-006)
  398: - [AC-S-002-US3-3] Given 5 failed sign-ins for a username, When a sixth is tried within 15 minutes (even with the right password), Then it is refused with a message to wait; after 15 minutes sign-in works again. (source: NFR-006)
  400: - [AC-S-002-US3-5] Given a password is set or changed, When it has fewer than 10 characters, Then it is rejected. (source: NFR-006)
