  419: - [AC-S-002-US4-1] Given a patient is signed in, When they ask for an appointment of a person who is not themselves or one of their family members, Then the system refuses it as if it did not exist. (source: FR-004, NFR-006)
  420: - [AC-S-002-US4-2] Given a receptionist of clinic A, When they ask for or change an appointment of clinic B, Then the system refuses. (source: FR-004, NFR-006)
  425: - [AC-S-002-US4-7] Given a request without sign-in, or one that changes data without coming from the BrightSmile website, When it is made, Then it is refused. (source: NFR-006)
